<h2>Use of this website</h2><p>By using the website or requesting a demo, you agree to provide accurate information and use the platform communication channels responsibly.</p>
<h2>Demo and tenant setup</h2><p>Submitting a request does not automatically create a tenant or guarantee approval. Classic Technologies may review details, schedule a presentation, confirm modules, create the tenant, and invite the tenant owner where suitable.</p>
<h2>Tenant responsibility</h2><p>Tenant owners are responsible for staff invitations, roles, permissions, branch setup, accurate customer information, transaction verification, day opening/closing, and compliance with applicable laws and internal controls.</p>
<h2>No unlawful use</h2><p>The platform must not be used for illegal transfers, fraud, false representation, money laundering, sanctions evasion, unauthorized access, or misuse of financial records.</p>
<h2>Billing, trials, and modules</h2><p>Plans, module access, addons, trials, invoices, grace periods, suspension, and reactivation can vary by agreement and platform configuration.</p>
<h2>Updates</h2><p>Classic Technologies may update these terms as services, policies, laws, deployment options, modules, or billing rules change.</p>
